# Pyramids Adhesives — Website Rebuild Implementation Plan

> **Branch:** `remake` | **Goal:** From-scratch rebuild into a premium, conversion-focused, internationally-positioned industrial adhesives website.

---

## Executive Summary

The rebuild transforms Pyramids from a generic product-listing site into a **world-class industrial B2B landing page** — benchmarked against Henkel, Sika, 3M, Bostik, and H.B. Fuller. The new site will lead with **export positioning** and **conversion triggers** (WhatsApp, quote requests) while keeping the same clean, scalable vanilla HTML/CSS/JS stack.

---

## Part 1: Asset Audit — Keep vs. Discard

### ✅ KEEP (Core Brand Assets)
| Asset | Path | Reason |
|---|---|---|
| Logo (no-bg) | `images/logos/logo-2-No-background.png` | Primary logo for header/footer |
| Favicon | `images/logos/logo-2.ico` | Browser tab icon |
| Logo mid | `images/logos/logo-5-mid.png` | Useful for dark backgrounds |
| All product images | `images/products/*/` | El-Borg, King, Forsan, Fox, Healthy, Fo-Max, Glue — all needed |
| Factory image | `images/image-13.jpg` | High-res manufacturing shot, great for hero/about |
| Flag images | `images/flags/` | Still needed for language switcher |
| i18n JSON files | `JS/English.json`, `JS/Arabic.json`, `JS/french.json` | Multilingual content preserved |
| `language.js` | `JS/language.js` | Core i18n logic, reused with minor updates |

### ❌ DISCARD / REPLACE
| Asset | Reason |
|---|---|
| `CSS/styles.css` | Full rewrite with new design system |
| `CSS/about.css` | Merging into single stylesheet |
| `index.html` | Full rewrite |
| `about.html` | Full rewrite |
| `images/400x300.jpg` | Placeholder, remove |
| `images/image-1.webp` through `image-12.jpg` | Replace with curated selections from existing set |
| Cloudinary video hero | Replacing with static dark hero image + overlay for faster load |
| jQuery dependency | Remove — replace scroll-to-top with 5 lines of vanilla JS |
| Bootstrap 5 CSS | **Remove!** — new site uses a bespoke CSS design system. Keep Bootstrap JS only for modal if needed, or replace entirely |

---

## Part 2: Design System

The new design language is **Dark Industrial Premium** — inspired by Henkel and Sika, adapted for a company with roots in Egypt and a global reach message.

### Color Palette
```css
/* Design Tokens */
--color-bg-primary:    #0A0E14;   /* Deep dark — main background */
--color-bg-secondary:  #111827;   /* Card & section backgrounds */
--color-bg-elevated:   #1C2333;   /* Elevated cards, modals */
--color-accent:        #F5A623;   /* Amber/Gold — primary CTA, highlights */
--color-accent-green:  #88BF47;   /* Brand green — retained from original */
--color-text-primary:  #F0F4F8;   /* Off-white body text */
--color-text-muted:    #8899AA;   /* Subtle labels and meta */
--color-border:        #2D3748;   /* Subtle card borders */
```

### Typography
```css
/* Google Fonts: Outfit (headings) + Inter (body) */
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@400;600;700;800;900&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap');

--font-heading: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
--font-body:    'Inter', sans-serif;
```

### Spacing Scale
```css
--space-xs:   0.5rem;
--space-sm:   1rem;
--space-md:   2rem;
--space-lg:   4rem;
--space-xl:   6rem;
--space-2xl:  8rem;
```

