 │  2. HERO                         │  Dark overlay on factory image, bold H1, 2 CTAs
 ├──────────────────────────────────┤
 │  3. TRUST BAR                    │  NEW: Scrolling logo ticker / stats stripe
 ├──────────────────────────────────┤
 │  4. ABOUT (Discover Pyramids)    │  Redesigned split-layout with badge
 ├──────────────────────────────────┤
 │  5. GLOBAL EXPORT  (NEW)         │  World map accent + 4 export pillars
 ├──────────────────────────────────┤
 │  6. PRODUCTS                     │  Redesigned product cards + enhanced modal
 ├──────────────────────────────────┤
 │  7. SERVICES                     │  Cleaner grid, fewer but stronger cards
 ├──────────────────────────────────┤
 │  8. TRUST / SOCIAL PROOF         │  NEW: Stats counter + "Used in factories..."
 ├──────────────────────────────────┤
