## Part 4: Section-by-Section Implementation Plan

### Section 1 — Header
- **Sticky** with `position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100`
- **Glassmorphism** on scroll: `backdrop-filter: blur(12px); background: rgba(10,14,20,0.85)` via JS scroll listener
- Same nav links (About, Services, Products, Contact)
- Language switcher retained, restyled
- Mobile: hamburger icon → full-screen slide-in menu

### Section 2 — Hero
- **Background**: `images/image-13.jpg` (factory) with a dark gradient overlay
- **Headline**: *"Strong Adhesives Built for Real Industry"* — `font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem)` in Outfit Black 900
- **Subheadline**: *"Hot Melt & Upholstery Adhesives Designed for Performance..."*
- **Export badge**: 🌍 We export to all countries worldwide — amber pill badge
- **CTAs**: Primary `Get a Quote` (amber fill) + Secondary `View Products` (outline)
- **Animation**: Hero text animates in word-by-word using CSS `@keyframes` reveal on load

### Section 3 — Trust Bar *(NEW)*
- Narrow stripe between hero and about
- Counter stats: `20+ Years Experience`, `7 Product Lines`, `Middle East & Africa Markets`
- Subtle separator line design

### Section 4 — Discover Pyramids (About Summary)
- Split 60/40 layout: image left, text right
- Keep `20+ Years of Service` badge overlay on the image
- Content: Company intro, Our Commitment, Our Vision cards
- Link to `about.html`

### Section 5 — Global Export Capabilities *(NEW SECTION)*
- Dark section background for contrast
- Large world outline graphic (SVG or CSS)
- 4 feature pillars: *Worldwide Export / Quick Logistics / Int'l Standards / ME & Africa Expertise*
- Trust line: *"Trusted partner for international adhesive supply"*

### Section 6 — Products
- **Product Cards** redesigned: dark card with image, product name, **use case tag** (e.g., "For Furniture & Foam"), and CTA button
- Hover effect: subtle glow + scale up
- **Enhanced Modal**:
  - `Best Value` badge on the large size
  - Highlighted size selection (click to select logic)
  - New CTA buttons: `Get Best Price Now` + `WhatsApp Us`
  - "Available for export worldwide" note at bottom
  - Use Case chips: Furniture Factories / Foam & Sponge / Upholstery
  - Feature badges: Strong Bond / Fast Drying / Heat Resistant / Egyptian Climate Ready

### Section 7 — Services
- Reduced from 9 cards to 6 strongest services
- Cleaner card layout, icons updated
- Preserve i18n keys

### Section 8 — Trust / Social Proof *(NEW)*
- `PureCounter` JS for animated counters
- 3 stats: `Trusted by Factories Across Egypt`, `Exporting to Multiple Markets`, `Used in Daily Production Lines`
- Dark background with amber accent numbers

### Section 9 — FAQ
- Keep all 6 Q&As, rebuild as CSS accordion (remove Bootstrap dependency)
- Smoother animation on expand/collapse

### Section 10 — CTA Banner
- Full-width section with dark-to-amber gradient
- *"Need the Right Adhesive for Your Application?"*
- Two buttons: `Request a Quote` + `Contact via WhatsApp` (green WhatsApp color)
- Sub-line: *"We handle local and international orders | Worldwide Export Available"*

### Section 11 — Contact
- Keep two-column layout (info + form)
- FormSubmit integration retained
- Updated contact info styling
- Form validation: HTML5 `required` + custom JS feedback

### Section 12 — Footer
- Three columns: Brand + Social | Useful Links | Contact Info
- Keep LinkedIn link
- Copyright updated to 2025

